  <jpcrp030000-asr_E00138-000:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row57Member">保有適否の検証の結果に基づき、当事業年度に全株式を売却しています。</jpcrp030000-asr_E00138-000:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
